{
  "quest.B55819AACFE9667F.title": "Certified Advanced Item Filter Moment",
  "quest.B55819AACFE9667F.quest_subtitle": "Craft or obtain Advanced Item Filter",
  "quest.B55819AACFE9667F.quest_desc": [
    "Advanced Item Filter — an item from the Ender IO mod.",
    "",
    "Ender IO turns your skyblock into a cable-strewn factory. Conduits, capacitors, and machines love a flat island with room to expand.",
    "",
    "How to make it:",
    "• Craft it in a shaped pattern — open JEI and search the item for the exact grid layout.",
    "• Shapeless crafting recipe — ingredients can sit anywhere in the grid.",
    "",
    "Skyblock tip: your random center block may eventually roll the parts — stash duplicates in storage until you have the full recipe."
  ],
  "task.D3035E2ADA63C2EA.title": "Obtain Advanced Item Filter",
